<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  {#
    Deliberately standalone (does not extend _layout.njk) — this is a
    single-page printable worksheet, not a sectioned legal document, so
    it carries none of _layout's buyer/terms/annexure section machinery.
    It still uses the full NexaCrest brand letterhead (logo, navy/gold)
    since — unlike CAFIN — this IS a genuine buyer-facing document.
  #}
  @page { margin: 0.6in 0.65in; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { font-family: 'Aptos', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: #1A1A1A; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }

  .letterhead { display: table; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 14pt; border-bottom: 2pt solid #17233A; padding-bottom: 8pt; }
  .letterhead .logo-cell { display: table-cell; width: 70pt; vertical-align: middle; }
  .letterhead .logo-cell img { max-width: 60pt; max-height: 60pt; }
  .letterhead .title-cell { display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 10pt; }
  .letterhead .company-name { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; color: #17233A; }
  .letterhead .doc-title { font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold; color: #B8860B; margin-top: 2pt; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; }

  .meta-line { font-size: 8.5pt; color: #555555; margin-bottom: 10pt; }

  .how-to-use { border: 1pt solid #B8860B; background: #FBF6E9; padding: 8pt 10pt; margin-bottom: 14pt; font-size: 9.5pt; }
  .how-to-use .label { font-weight: bold; color: #17233A; display: block; margin-bottom: 4pt; }
  .how-to-use ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 16pt; }
  .how-to-use li { margin-bottom: 3pt; }

  .section-title { background: #17233A; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 10.5pt; font-weight: bold;
    padding: 5pt 9pt; margin-bottom: 0; }

  table.endorsement td { border: 1pt solid #999999; padding: 6pt 9pt; vertical-align: top; font-size: 9.5pt; }
  table.endorsement td.field-label { width: 32%; font-weight: bold; color: #17233A; background: #F4F4F4; }
  table.endorsement td.field-value { width: 68%; }

  .signatory-block { margin-top: 22pt; display: table; width: 100%; }
  .signatory-block .seal-cell { display: table-cell; width: 50%; vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center; }
  .signatory-block .sig-cell { display: table-cell; width: 50%; vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center; }
  .signatory-block img.seal { max-height: 70pt; max-width: 70pt; }
  .signatory-block img.signature { max-height: 40pt; max-width: 160pt; display: block; margin: 0 auto 4pt; }
  .signatory-block .name { font-weight: bold; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 4pt; }
  .signatory-block .designation { font-size: 9pt; color: #444444; }
  .signatory-block .for-company { font-size: 9pt; color: #444444; margin-bottom: 4pt; }
  .signatory-block .line { border-top: 1pt solid #999999; margin-top: 6pt; padding-top: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; color: #666666; }

  .footer-note { margin-top: 16pt; font-size: 8pt; font-style: italic; color: #666666; border-top: 1pt solid #CCCCCC; padding-top: 6pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="letterhead">
  <div class="logo-cell">
    {% if assets.logo_data_uri %}<img src="{{ assets.logo_data_uri }}" alt="NexaCrest">{% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="title-cell">
    <div class="company-name">{{ company.legal_name }}</div>
    <div class="doc-title">BILL OF LADING ENDORSEMENT</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="meta-line">
  Order {{ order.order_reference }} &middot; Document Ref {{ meta.document_reference }} &middot; Rev.{{ '%02d'|format(meta.revision_number) }} &middot; Generated {{ meta.generated_date }}
</div>

<div class="how-to-use">
  <span class="label">HOW TO USE</span>
  <ul>
    <li>Print and write by hand — or have a rubber stamp made of the endorsement box below.</li>
    <li>Complete one endorsement on the reverse of EACH of the 3 original Bills of Lading. All 3 must be endorsed.</li>
    <li>Endorse ONLY after the Balance Payment is confirmed as Payment Cleared in NexaCrest's bank account.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="section-title">ENDORSEMENT — WRITE ON REVERSE OF EACH ORIGINAL BL</div>
<table class="endorsement">
  <tr>
    <td class="field-label">Pay to the order of (Consignee)</td>
    <td class="field-value">{{ consignee.company_legal_name or 'To Be Confirmed' }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="field-label">BL Number</td>
    <td class="field-value">{{ endorsement.bl_number or 'To Be Confirmed' }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="field-label">Vessel / Voyage</td>
    <td class="field-value">{{ endorsement.vessel_voyage or 'To Be Confirmed' }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="field-label">Port of Loading</td>
    <td class="field-value">{{ endorsement.port_of_loading or 'To Be Confirmed' }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="field-label">Port of Discharge</td>
    <td class="field-value">{{ endorsement.port_of_discharge or 'To Be Confirmed' }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="field-label">Proforma Invoice No.</td>
    <td class="field-value">{{ pi_reference or 'To Be Confirmed' }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="field-label">Commercial Invoice No.</td>
    <td class="field-value">{{ ci_reference or 'To Be Confirmed' }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="field-label">Date of Endorsement</td>
    <td class="field-value">{{ (endorsement.date_of_endorsement | date) if endorsement.date_of_endorsement else 'To Be Confirmed' }}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div class="signatory-block">
  <div class="seal-cell">
    {% if signatory.company_seal_data_uri %}<img class="seal" src="{{ signatory.company_seal_data_uri }}" alt="Company Seal">{% endif %}
    <div class="for-company">For {{ company.legal_name }}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="sig-cell">
    {% if signatory.signature_data_uri %}<img class="signature" src="{{ signatory.signature_data_uri }}" alt="Signature">{% endif %}
    {% if signatory.seal_data_uri %}<img class="seal" src="{{ signatory.seal_data_uri }}" alt="Designation Seal">{% endif %}
    <div class="line">Authorised Signatory</div>
    <div class="name">{{ signatory.name }}</div>
    <div class="designation">{{ signatory.designation }}</div>
    <div class="designation">GSTIN: {{ company.gstin }} | IEC: {{ company.iec_pan }}</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="footer-note">
  This endorsement record is generated from NexaCrest's own order data and is not itself a negotiable instrument — it exists solely to guide the physical endorsement written or stamped on the reverse of each original Bill of Lading.
</div>

</body>
</html>
